This product contains modified source derived from bumble-rs
(https://github.com/chaitanyarahalkar/bumble-rs) and its Rust port of parts of
Google's Bumble Bluetooth stack (https://github.com/google/bumble). Those
works are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The extraction baseline is niart120/bumble-rs revision
cb55e2d98dc7b7b0227c43772c9ae184034dd9a1. The modifications reorganize the
required Bluetooth Classic HID behavior into one package, remove unrelated
protocol and transport surfaces, and introduce a backend-specific API for
swbt-rs.

Wire formats, constants, and protocol test vectors are derived from the
projects above and from the Bluetooth Core Specification.

